facts={1583:['InteriorExposure compensation is intentionally smoothed temporal perception, distinct from current target; FixedViewExposure settles immediately per camera. Same max6-stop/daylight-owned target feeds both. Real render clock intentionally advances during virtual pause. scene change resets compensation, current target updates settled equality each actual adapt call; no gameplay clock duplication.','compensation_at samples full current CPU fields for perception while GPU field selection is bounded renderer residency. No promise every arbitrarily overlapping/overbudget field has identical pixel/light treatment; explicit budget/projection relationship retained rather than blanket CPU/GPU equality. Missing camera returns without state update, missing celestial resets main exposure; fixed view missing snapshot returns unchanged. These are distinct lifecycle paths and no proven readiness caller error asserted.'],1584:['InteriorField base_samples retain geometry-derived fixed transmission without shutter contributions; current samples derive base plus current openness per shutter. Two snapshots denote deliberately different dependency stages, not independently authored current light truth. opening light matching canonicalassembly by geometry/tolerance is current explicit source linking, not proof arbitrary contradictory plan fields cannot misbind. Preserve existing plan admission/aggregate identity concerns.','Cell sample index repeated local calculation is deterministic operation-local arithmetic, not independently mutable source. positive.w is room ID+1 while zero means outside, different role from six irradiance lobes. Storey height, dimensions, origin and sample layout all generated once from same plan; later public/raw member mutation not sealed by record alone, and no normal mutator outside actual shutter update demonstrated.'],1585:['StandardMaterial remains canonical authored asset. Added source gets exactly one cached ExtendedMaterial; Modified event copies base with intentional Forward override, removal evicts cache lookup while existing entity handle may retain historical last native object. This is explicit source/native projection ownership and actual lifecycle invalidation, unlike global equality fastpath inF042.','Gpu field buffer handle is fixed startup-owned resource used by extensions. Replacing the entire InteriorLightingGpu buffer later would require rebind, but no actual producer does so in inspected graph. Arbitrary future GPU resource replacement not accepted stale-material defect. No duplicate draw retained: source MeshMaterial3d removed and saved in InteriorMaterialSource.'],1586:['Upload selection depends on exact active-camera positions, field identity/fulltransform and Ref<InteriorField> change plus current daylight. Nearest sort and budget happen anew before key comparison; selectedentity+matrix and field change cover actual subsequent output dependencies. Different camera positions giving same selected cohort intentionally skip same data upload; output daylight/outdoor factor derives same day source.','Fixed padded sample vector preserves native allocation shape; previous REG002 actual ShaderBuffer::set_data/prepare behavior supports same-size native binding reuse. Count/offset/building matrices are derived native layout, not separate authored bounds. Fresh actual shader511 matches struct16/offset/room-grid contract; WGSL interpolation versus CPU cell reference is intentionally different sampling kernel.','No cameras clears selection and computed field; removed buildings change selection and remove their light. No proof of external shaderbuffer removal; if missing native asset then gpu.data still updated and later equal key may skip retry, a conditional lifecycle caveat rather than observed normal defect. Native grid overflow/finite inversion and arbitrary malformed fields remain operations/admission obligations, not cleared.'],1587:['ShutterLight openness is tolerance-owned projection of actual current replicated leaf tangent, used as last applied aperture rather than exact live physical angle. Newcurrent samples derive entire baseline+all accepted aperture values when any applied value changes, preserving room metadata and clamp; no iterative accumulation drift. Missing window maps closed by explicit source policy.','OpeningAssemblyId binds actual window/building and contribution; filter restricts same building. Contributions/base snapshots generated from original plan; actual plan replacement requires field reconstruction, no in-place plan edit producer demonstrated. bypass_change_detection then set_changed only for accepted numeric delta ensures upload sees real sample changes. NaN/malformed transforms and tangent frame guarantee remain separate actual source obligations.'],1588:['Full331 fixture lines consumed, including synthetic room/otherfloor geometry, rotated inverse frame, 20-building/two-view budget/removal, fixed sample allocation, real-clock exposure duringpause/night and actual StandardMaterial modification pipeline. All are independent reference observations with explicit authored values; no app/test execution and no general hostile input coherence proof from fixtures. Material/field projection and event behavior accepted only for traced source roles.']}
